{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ev4adiOmZc1794562587.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>房委會資助房屋小組通過兩項資助出售單位優化措施。</p><p></p><p>由下一期居屋銷售計劃起，新生嬰兒白表家庭申請者最高按揭成數由九成，放寬至九成半，下期計劃申請截止當日，有三歲或以下子女的家庭均可受惠。</p><p></p><p>委員會亦通過2022至2025年期間，首次推售的資助出售單位，在公開市場轉讓限制年期由15年縮短至10年。</p><p></p><p>房委會指，兩項措施將協助更多家庭置業，亦促進資助出售單位流轉，全方位協助市民安居。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.927522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:57:51.288974+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:09.084435+00:00","content_hash":"c1e0e60fc990022f891018de39ea21eb4954da13d278045c68ca118c1456cdd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.927522+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}